    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic game mode: Solve 99 randomly generated mazes! The faster you solve the maze, the more stars you earn. The mazes get larger and more difficult as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen mode: Take your sweet time to solve mazes. When you finish one, another will be generated immediately for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race mode: Destroy your friends and family locally in this competitive race to the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag mode: Runners earn points by evading the chaser; Chasers earn even more points by tagging a runner.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic game mode: Solve 99 randomly generated mazes! The faster you solve the maze, the more stars you earn. The mazes get larger and more difficult as you progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen mode: Take your sweet time to solve mazes. When you finish one, another will be generated immediately for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race mode: Destroy your friends and family locally in this competitive race to the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag mode: Runners earn points by evading the chaser; Chasers earn even more points by tagging a runner.</p>",
    "short_description": "A casual, retro, Atari-inspired maze traversing game. Controllers recommended! Play by yourself or couch-coop with your friends and family.",
